msgstr "Ongeza anwani ya barua pepe ili ununue uanachama"

#: templates/accounts/profile.html templates/components/contact_verification_notice.html
msgid "Adding an email address is not available right now. Please try again later or contact ClipCash support."
msgstr "Kuongeza anwani ya barua pepe hakupatikani kwa sasa. Tafadhali jaribu tena baadaye au wasiliana na usaidizi wa ClipCash."

#: templates/public/home.html
msgid "An email address, a Tanzanian mobile number or a username, and a password. Your account works straight away, and creating it is free. Buying a membership needs a confirmed email address."
msgstr "Anwani ya barua pepe, namba ya simu ya Tanzania au jina la mtumiaji, pamoja na nenosiri. Akaunti yako inafanya kazi mara moja, na kuifungua ni bure. Kununua uanachama kunahitaji anwani ya barua pepe iliyothibitishwa."

#: templates/payments/manual_pay.html
msgid "Check that the provider shows the recipient name above before you confirm. Pay the exact amount in one payment: partial or extra amounts cannot be matched automatically. Never share your payment PIN with anyone, including ClipCash staff."
msgstr "Hakikisha mtoa huduma anaonyesha jina la mpokeaji lililo hapo juu kabla ya kuthibitisha. Lipa kiasi kamili kwa muamala mmoja: kiasi pungufu au cha ziada hakiwezi kulinganishwa kiotomatiki. Usimpe mtu yeyote PIN yako ya malipo, hata wafanyakazi wa ClipCash."

#: templates/payments/manual_pay.html
msgid "Choose a payment method"
msgstr "Chagua njia ya malipo"

#: templates/public/home.html
msgid "Choose a plan from your dashboard. It stays pending until it is activated: pay with an available payment method, submit your transaction reference, and the ClipCash team activates it after checking the payment."
msgstr "Chagua mpango kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako. Unabaki unasubiri mpaka uwezeshwe: lipa kwa njia ya malipo inayopatikana, wasilisha kumbukumbu ya muamala wako, na timu ya ClipCash itauwezesha baada ya kuhakiki malipo."

#: templates/accounts/phone_verify.html
msgid "ClipCash staff will never ask for this code. Never share it with anyone."
msgstr "Wafanyakazi wa ClipCash hawatakuomba msimbo huu kamwe. Usimpe mtu yeyote."

#: templates/memberships/my_membership.html templates/memberships/subscription_detail.html
msgid "Complimentary access: no payment was made, and access ends on the date below. Nothing renews automatically."
msgstr "Ufikiaji uliotolewa bure: hakuna malipo yaliyofanyika, na ufikiaji unaisha tarehe iliyo hapa chini. Hakuna kinachoongezewa muda kiotomatiki."

