msgstr "Simu ya mawasiliano"

#: templates/public/home.html
msgid "Create an account with your email address, your mobile number or a username, and a password. It is free, and you can use it straight away."
msgstr "Fungua akaunti kwa anwani yako ya barua pepe, namba yako ya simu au jina la mtumiaji, pamoja na nenosiri. Ni bure, na unaweza kuitumia mara moja."

#: templates/accounts/layout.html
msgid "Create your account with a username, a password and an email address or mobile number."
