msgid "Not available to demo accounts without a confirmed email address: it involves payments, financial records or business verification, which stay restricted in this demonstration."
msgstr "Haipatikani kwa akaunti za majaribio zisizo na barua pepe iliyothibitishwa: inahusu malipo, kumbukumbu za fedha au uthibitisho wa biashara, ambavyo vimezuiliwa katika maonyesho haya."

