msgid "Optional for members. Used for password recovery once verified."
msgstr "Si lazima kwa wanachama. Hutumika kurejesha nenosiri baada ya kuthibitishwa."

msgid "Optional. Stored in international format, for example +255712345678."
msgstr "Si lazima. Huhifadhiwa kwa muundo wa kimataifa, kwa mfano +255712345678."

msgid "Ownership of the number was proven (by SMS). Not required to sign in; an unverified number is never used to recover an account."
msgstr "Umiliki wa namba umethibitishwa (kwa SMS). Hauhitajiki kuingia; namba isiyothibitishwa haitumiki kamwe kurejesha akaunti."

msgid "Derived from status: only ACTIVE accounts are active."
msgstr "Hutokana na hali: akaunti zenye hali ya ACTIVE pekee ndizo hai."

msgid "Derived from role: Super Administrators and Content Managers are staff."
msgstr "Hutokana na jukumu: Wasimamizi Wakuu na Wasimamizi wa Maudhui ni wafanyakazi."

msgid "Derived from role: only Super Administrators are superusers."
msgstr "Hutokana na jukumu: Wasimamizi Wakuu pekee ndio wasimamizi wakuu wa mfumo."

msgid "Created by public sign-up: the email address signs in and recovers the account only after its ownership is confirmed."
msgstr "Imeundwa kwa usajili wa umma: barua pepe hutumika kuingia na kurejesha akaunti baada tu ya umiliki wake kuthibitishwa."

msgid "Waiting for the code"
msgstr "Inasubiri msimbo"

msgid "Verified"
msgstr "Imethibitishwa"

msgid "Too many attempts"
msgstr "Majaribio mengi mno"

msgid "Replaced or no longer valid"
msgstr "Imebadilishwa au si halali tena"

msgid "Could not be sent"
msgstr "Haikuweza kutumwa"

msgid "At least one active Super Administrator must remain."
msgstr "Lazima abaki angalau Msimamizi Mkuu mmoja aliye hai."

msgid "Staff and superuser flags must match the role."
msgstr "Alama za mfanyakazi na msimamizi mkuu lazima zilingane na jukumu."

msgid "The active flag must match the account status."
msgstr "Alama ya hai lazima ilingane na hali ya akaunti."

msgid "An account cannot be returned to Pending."
msgstr "Akaunti haiwezi kurudishwa kwenye hali ya Inasubiri."

msgid "Your password must contain at least one letter and at least one number."
msgstr "Nenosiri lako lazima liwe na angalau herufi moja na angalau tarakimu moja."

msgid "Your password must contain at least %(min_length)d character."
msgid_plural "Your password must contain at least %(min_length)d characters."
msgstr[0] "Nenosiri lako lazima liwe na angalau herufi %(min_length)d."
msgstr[1] "Nenosiri lako lazima liwe na angalau herufi %(min_length)d."

msgid "Member passwords must contain at least one letter and at least one number."
msgstr "Manenosiri ya wanachama lazima yawe na angalau herufi moja na angalau tarakimu moja."

msgid "Use at least %(min)d characters, with at least one letter and at least one number. Spaces are allowed, so a short phrase of unrelated words with a number in it is easy to remember and hard to guess. Avoid your name, username, phone number or email address."
msgstr "Tumia angalau herufi %(min)d, zikiwemo angalau herufi moja na tarakimu moja. Nafasi zinaruhusiwa, hivyo kifungu kifupi cha maneno yasiyohusiana chenye namba ni rahisi kukumbuka na kigumu kukisia. Epuka jina lako, jina la mtumiaji, namba ya simu au barua pepe."

msgid "Staff accounts need at least %(min)d characters. Avoid your name, email address or phone number, and common passwords."
msgstr "Akaunti za wafanyakazi zinahitaji angalau herufi %(min)d. Epuka jina lako, barua pepe au namba ya simu, na manenosiri yaliyozoeleka."

msgid "Member passwords must contain at least %(member)d characters; staff passwords at least %(staff)d."
msgstr "Manenosiri ya wanachama lazima yawe na angalau herufi %(member)d; ya wafanyakazi angalau %(staff)d."

msgid "You are not allowed to manage accounts."
msgstr "Huruhusiwi kusimamia akaunti."

msgid "Only Super Administrators can create staff accounts."
msgstr "Wasimamizi Wakuu pekee wanaweza kuunda akaunti za wafanyakazi."

msgid "New accounts must be Pending or Active."
msgstr "Akaunti mpya lazima ziwe Zinasubiri au Hai."

msgid "Only Super Administrators can manage staff accounts or their own account."
msgstr "Wasimamizi Wakuu pekee wanaweza kusimamia akaunti za wafanyakazi au akaunti zao wenyewe."

msgid "Only Super Administrators can change roles."
msgstr "Wasimamizi Wakuu pekee wanaweza kubadilisha majukumu."

msgid "An account cannot move from %(old)s to %(new)s."
msgstr "Akaunti haiwezi kuhama kutoka %(old)s kwenda %(new)s."

msgid "Only Super Administrators can reactivate disabled accounts."
msgstr "Wasimamizi Wakuu pekee wanaweza kuwezesha tena akaunti zilizozimwa."

msgid "3 to 30 characters: letters, numbers, dots (.) and underscores (_). It must start with a letter. Capital letters do not matter: Amina.K and amina.k are the same username."
msgstr "Herufi 3 hadi 30: herufi, tarakimu, nukta (.) na mistari ya chini (_). Lazima lianze na herufi. Herufi kubwa hazina tofauti: Amina.K na amina.k ni jina moja la mtumiaji."

msgid "A username cannot contain @. To sign in with an email address, choose “Email address” instead."
msgstr "Jina la mtumiaji haliwezi kuwa na @. Ili kuingia kwa barua pepe, chagua “Barua pepe” badala yake."

msgid "A username must start with a letter, so it cannot be mistaken for a mobile number. To sign in with your number, choose “Mobile number” instead."
msgstr "Jina la mtumiaji lazima lianze na herufi ili lisichanganywe na namba ya simu. Ili kuingia kwa namba yako, chagua “Namba ya simu” badala yake."

msgid "Use only letters (a–z), numbers, dots (.) and underscores (_), with no spaces."
msgstr "Tumia herufi (a–z), tarakimu, nukta (.) na mistari ya chini (_) pekee, bila nafasi."

msgid "A username cannot contain two dots in a row or end with a dot."
msgstr "Jina la mtumiaji haliwezi kuwa na nukta mbili mfululizo au kuishia na nukta."

msgid "This username is reserved. Please choose another one."
msgstr "Jina hili la mtumiaji limehifadhiwa. Tafadhali chagua jingine."

msgid "A username must be between %(min)d and %(max)d characters long."
msgstr "Jina la mtumiaji lazima liwe na herufi kati ya %(min)d na %(max)d."

msgid "An account already uses this email address. Sign in instead, or reset your password."
msgstr "Tayari kuna akaunti inayotumia barua pepe hii. Ingia badala yake, au rejesha nenosiri lako."

msgid "This username is already taken. Please choose another one."
msgstr "Jina hili la mtumiaji tayari linatumika. Tafadhali chagua jingine."

msgid "If your email address still needs confirming, a link is on its way."
msgstr "Ikiwa barua pepe yako bado inahitaji kuthibitishwa, kiungo kinakuja."

msgid "Your mobile number is verified."
msgstr "Namba yako ya simu imethibitishwa."

msgid "If your mobile number can receive text messages, a code is on its way. It expires in %(m)s minutes."
msgstr "Ikiwa namba yako ya simu inaweza kupokea ujumbe mfupi, msimbo unakuja. Unaisha baada ya dakika %(m)s."

msgid "We could not send a code by SMS. Please try again later."
msgstr "Hatukuweza kutuma msimbo kwa SMS. Tafadhali jaribu tena baadaye."

msgid "Too many attempts. Please try again later."
msgstr "Majaribio mengi mno. Tafadhali jaribu tena baadaye."

msgid "Too many incorrect codes. Ask for a new code."
msgstr "Misimbo isiyo sahihi ni mingi mno. Omba msimbo mpya."

msgid "That code is not valid or has expired. Check it, or ask for a new code."
msgstr "Msimbo huo si sahihi au umeisha muda. Ukague, au omba msimbo mpya."

msgid "Too many codes were requested. Please try again later."
msgstr "Misimbo mingi mno imeombwa. Tafadhali jaribu tena baadaye."

msgid "This mobile number is already verified."
msgstr "Namba hii ya simu tayari imethibitishwa."

msgid "Add a mobile number to your account first."
msgstr "Kwanza ongeza namba ya simu kwenye akaunti yako."

msgid "Please wait %(s)s seconds before asking for another code."
msgstr "Tafadhali subiri sekunde %(s)s kabla ya kuomba msimbo mwingine."

msgid "Name shown to members"
msgstr "Jina linaloonyeshwa kwa wanachama"

msgid "Registered recipient name"
msgstr "Jina la mpokeaji lililosajiliwa"

