msgid "No rewards yet."
msgstr "Bado hakuna zawadi."

msgid "Released obligations (available to members)"
msgstr "Madeni yaliyoachiliwa (yanapatikana kwa wanachama)"

msgid "Reserved for open sessions"
msgstr "Kilichohifadhiwa kwa vipindi vilivyo wazi"

msgid "Clearance period"
msgstr "Kipindi cha kusubiri"

msgid "%(n)s hour"
msgid_plural "%(n)s hours"
msgstr[0] "saa %(n)s"
msgstr[1] "saa %(n)s"

msgid "Rewards on hold"
msgstr "Zawadi zilizosimamishwa"

msgid "Need manual recovery"
msgstr "Zinahitaji kurejeshwa kwa mkono"

msgid "Search campaigns, videos or advertisers"
msgstr "Tafuta kampeni, video au watangazaji"

msgid "Rewards by campaign"
msgstr "Zawadi kwa kampeni"

msgid "Video / campaign"
msgstr "Video / kampeni"

msgid "Obligations"
msgstr "Madeni"

msgid "Draft awaiting approval"
msgstr "Rasimu inasubiri idhini"

msgid "Consumed"
msgstr "Iliyotumika"

msgid "No approved campaigns yet."
msgstr "Bado hakuna kampeni zilizoidhinishwa."

msgid "Reward policy"
msgstr "Sera ya zawadi"

msgid "Approved policies cannot be edited. Sessions already started keep the TZS amount they were offered."
msgstr "Sera zilizoidhinishwa haziwezi kuhaririwa. Vipindi vilivyokwisha anza huendelea na kiasi cha TZS walichoahidiwa."

msgid "Only campaigns that show a TZS amount pay real rewards."
msgstr "Kampeni zinazoonyesha kiasi cha TZS pekee ndizo hulipa zawadi halisi."

msgid "A reward is paid only after ClipCash verifies the view, while the campaign's funding and your daily limit allow it. It stays pending during a clearance period before it becomes available. Earnings are not guaranteed, and withdrawals are not available yet."
msgstr "Zawadi hulipwa tu baada ya ClipCash kuhakiki utazamaji, wakati ufadhili wa kampeni na kikomo chako cha kila siku vinaruhusu. Hubaki ikisubiri kwa kipindi cha kusubiri kabla haijapatikana. Mapato hayana uhakika, na utoaji wa pesa bado haupatikani."

msgid "%(amount)s per verified view"
msgstr "%(amount)s kwa kila utazamaji uliohakikiwa"

msgid "Your wallet shows real TZS rewards from verified views."
msgstr "Pochi yako inaonyesha zawadi halisi za TZS kutokana na utazamaji uliohakikiwa."

msgid "New rewards are pending for a clearance period, then become available. Non-cash credits never appear here. Withdrawals are not available yet."
msgstr "Zawadi mpya husubiri kwa kipindi cha kusubiri, kisha hupatikana. Krediti zisizo fedha haziwahi kuonekana hapa. Utoaji wa pesa bado haupatikani."

msgid "This session earns %(amount)s if ClipCash verifies the view. The amount is fixed for this session."
msgstr "Kipindi hiki kinapata %(amount)s ikiwa ClipCash itahakiki utazamaji. Kiasi hiki ni cha kudumu kwa kipindi hiki."

msgid "%(amount)s reward pending"
msgstr "Zawadi ya %(amount)s inasubiri"

msgid "It becomes available in your wallet on %(date)s, unless the view is reviewed."
msgstr "Itapatikana kwenye pochi yako tarehe %(date)s, isipokuwa utazamaji ukaguliwe."

msgid "It is on hold while ClipCash reviews it."
msgstr "Imesimamishwa wakati ClipCash inaikagua."

msgid "%(amount)s added to your available balance."
msgstr "%(amount)s imeongezwa kwenye salio lako linalopatikana."

msgid "No reward for this view."
msgstr "Hakuna zawadi kwa utazamaji huu."

msgid "The %(amount)s reward was reversed after a review."
msgstr "Zawadi ya %(amount)s ilibatilishwa baada ya ukaguzi."

msgid "Open your wallet"
msgstr "Fungua pochi yako"

msgid "Earn %(amount)s per verified view"
msgstr "Pata %(amount)s kwa kila utazamaji uliohakikiwa"

msgid "ClipCash checks the session on its server when the video ends; only a verified view earns the reward."
msgstr "ClipCash hukagua kipindi kwenye seva yake video inapoisha; utazamaji uliohakikiwa pekee ndio hupata zawadi."

msgid "The TZS amount shown when you press Start is fixed for that session. It is pending for a clearance period, then becomes available in your wallet. Withdrawals are not available yet."
msgstr "Kiasi cha TZS kinachoonyeshwa unapobonyeza Anza ni cha kudumu kwa kipindi hicho. Husubiri kwa kipindi cha kusubiri, kisha hupatikana kwenye pochi yako. Utoaji wa pesa bado haupatikani."

msgid "Watch a sponsored video in full and, once ClipCash verifies the view, you earn the reward shown: a TZS amount, or non-cash credits that are not money. Library videos earn nothing."
msgstr "Tazama video iliyodhaminiwa yote na, ClipCash ikishahakiki utazamaji, unapata zawadi iliyoonyeshwa: kiasi cha TZS, au krediti zisizo fedha. Video za maktaba hazipati chochote."

msgid "Pending rewards"
msgstr "Zawadi zinazosubiri"

msgid "On hold for review"
msgstr "Imesimamishwa kwa ukaguzi"

msgid "Available from %(date)s"
msgstr "Inapatikana kuanzia %(date)s"

msgid "No rewards are pending."
msgstr "Hakuna zawadi zinazosubiri."

msgid "Today: %(n)s rewarded view, %(total)s."
msgid_plural "Today: %(n)s rewarded views, %(total)s."
msgstr[0] "Leo: utazamaji %(n)s wenye zawadi, %(total)s."
msgstr[1] "Leo: utazamaji %(n)s wenye zawadi, %(total)s."

msgid "Daily earning limit: %(limit)s."
msgstr "Kikomo cha mapato kwa siku: %(limit)s."

msgid "Daily limit: %(n)s rewarded view."
msgid_plural "Daily limit: %(n)s rewarded views."
msgstr[0] "Kikomo cha kila siku: utazamaji %(n)s wenye zawadi."
msgstr[1] "Kikomo cha kila siku: utazamaji %(n)s wenye zawadi."

msgid "Open your wallet to see where real rewards appear. Opening a wallet does not create any money."
msgstr "Fungua pochi yako uone mahali zawadi halisi zinapoonekana. Kufungua pochi hakuleti fedha yoyote."

msgid "No wallet transactions yet. Rewards appear here after a verified view of a campaign that shows a TZS amount."
msgstr "Bado hakuna miamala ya pochi. Zawadi huonekana hapa baada ya utazamaji uliohakikiwa wa kampeni inayoonyesha kiasi cha TZS."
